# Anomaly Engine - credential template.
#
# Copy to `.env` and fill in what you need. `.env` is gitignored; this file is
# tracked and must never carry a real value - the secret scan fails the build if
# it does.
#
# Every key here is optional. The engine runs fully offline with none of them
# set, and it does not load `.env` today: this file documents which credentials
# the project knows about so that the answer to "where would a key go?" is
# written down before the first one exists, rather than discovered when one is
# found in a commit.
#
# Declared by tools/secret-keys.mjs; keep the two in step.

# OpenWeatherMap current-weather key. Read by OpenWeatherMapProvider in
# src/Engine/src/systems/WeatherSystem.ts (currently never constructed).
# https://home.openweathermap.org/api_keys
OPENWEATHER_API_KEY=
